  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIA PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophia Patel is a researcher meeting Anatoly Chernyaev at the University of Michigan Museum of Art to discuss a potential collaboration on an upcoming exhibition."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANATOLY CHERNYAEV&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anatoly Chernyaev is a renowned researcher with exceptional skills in art history and a deep passion for uncovering hidden stories in artworks."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF MICHIGAN MUSEUM OF ART&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Michigan Museum of Art is the venue where Dr. Sophia Patel meets Anatoly Chernyaev to discuss their collaboration."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANN ARBOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ann Arbor is the city where the events take place, specifically the streets where Dr. Sophia Patel walks and the University of Michigan Museum of Art is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MONET WATER LILY PAINTING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ARTWORK"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Monet water lily painting is one of the artworks discussed by Anatoly Chernyaev during their meeting with Dr. Sophia Patel."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IVAN MIKHAILOVICH SECHENOV&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ivan Mikhailovich Sechenov is the namesake of I.M. Sechenov First Moscow State Medical University, a prestigious institution in Moscow, Russia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;I.M. SECHENOV FIRST MOSCOW STATE MEDICAL UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"I.M. Sechenov First Moscow State Medical University is a prestigious medical institution in Moscow, Russia, where Anatoly Chernyaev worked and conducted groundbreaking research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORCID IDENTIFIER 0000-0002-2476-1774&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"IDENTIFIER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ORCID identifier 0000-0002-2476-1774 is associated with Anatoly Chernyaev, representing his unique academic identity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE ROLE OF OXIDATIVE STRESS IN CARDIOVASCULAR DISEASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PUBLICATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The publication 'The Role of Oxidative Stress in Cardiovascular Disease' is one of Anatoly Chernyaev's seminal works, co-authored with colleagues at I.M. Sechenov First Moscow State Medical University."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF CARDIOVASCULAR RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"JOURNAL"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Journal of Cardiovascular Research is the publication where Anatoly Chernyaev's seminal work on oxidative stress in cardiovascular disease was published."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF PHARMACOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"JOURNAL"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The European Journal of Pharmacology is one of the esteemed journals where Anatoly Chernyaev's research on molecular mechanisms underlying various diseases was published."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF MOLECULAR MEDICINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"JOURNAL"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Journal of Molecular Medicine is another esteemed journal where Anatoly Chernyaev's research on molecular mechanisms was published."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. NATALIA PETROVA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Natalia Petrova is a renowned expert in molecular biology who collaborated with Anatoly Chernyaev on several research projects at I.M. Sechenov First Moscow State Medical University."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CARDIOVASCULAR DISEASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DISEASE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cardiovascular Disease is the subject of Anatoly Chernyaev's research, particularly in relation to oxidative stress."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OXIDATIVE STRESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONDITION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Oxidative Stress is a condition studied by Anatoly Chernyaev in relation to cardiovascular disease."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MOLECULAR BIOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FIELD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Molecular Biology is the field of expertise of Dr. Natalia Petrova and a focus area in Anatoly Chernyaev's research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PHYSIOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FIELD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Physiology is the field named after Ivan Mikhailovich Sechenov, the namesake of I.M. Sechenov First Moscow State Medical University."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research is the primary activity of both Dr. Sophia Patel and Anatoly Chernyaev, involving collaboration and publication."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TEACHING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Teaching is an activity of Anatoly Chernyaev, known for his ability to engage students and educators alike."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ART HISTORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FIELD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Art History is the field of expertise of Anatoly Chernyaev, particularly in relation to his discussions with Dr. Sophia Patel."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHERNYAEV&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chernyaev is known for his ability to teach complex concepts in an accessible and engaging manner, and is remembered fondly by his students for his passion and commitment to their intellectual growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STUDENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Students are individuals who have been taught by Chernyaev and have gone on to become prominent researchers themselves."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"University is the institution where Chernyaev teaches and is affiliated with, as evidenced by annual reports and faculty directories."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROMINENT RESEARCHERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Prominent researchers are individuals who have succeeded Chernyaev's students and are recognized for their work in their fields."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANNUAL REPORTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Annual reports are documents published by the university that include information about Chernyaev's affiliation and contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FACULTY DIRECTORIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Faculty directories are resources that list Chernyaev's name and position within the university."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0496</data>
    </node>
